          "value": "Expressed in pollen (at protein level) (PubMed:11906336, PubMed:12859456, PubMed:16179793, PubMed:17177673, Ref.4). Expressed in stem, but not leaves (at protein level) (PubMed:12859456). Expressed in pollen (PubMed:12859456)"
